{"id":196,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>2026年3月22日，材料科学与工程学院团委青志部于09201H教室成功举办“雷锋月”主题志愿活动答辩会。学院团委副书记李红丹老师、各团支部代表及各青支队齐聚一堂，以答辩为载体，展示志愿实践成果，传承新时代雷锋精神，凝聚青春公益力量。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=mMRQNkLmvYL8liUT4TkMmUbUlWRMzLtYUz78Mzv8UmA7MRG0gihFp2hmCIa0MYh7Mky4U1y8M8UsM7l8MRCYnzN8LzL8LzQfUmNbnl74nNrFMmUboR-iM7VFLzr7LzlJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0Lz9aoR9Jqdjnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=18088&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7D43B47D74E4462E9413416AB99EA3FE/6498254A/15D15\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=mnRfN2nRL8UmL4nTzARnRlsU4LsMRWt2M8UZM7nfUm6RLRU0gihFp2hmCIa0USybnkyYMSh7n7WfnR74M77ZUz62L4Q7MN-ZoRGZMz7sLRQFM4TkLmCZMNWFUzT2L7CJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0Lz9aoR9Jqdjnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=18088&e=.png\"></p><p>答辩现场，各青支队代表登台展示，以图文并茂的PPT和生动讲述，全面呈现了各具特色、内涵丰富的志愿实践。材料学子立足校园、辐射社会，将雷锋精神与时代需求深度结合，打造了一系列有温度、有特色、有影响的志愿服务品牌：有的聚焦生态保护，通过环保宣讲与种花实践，以实际行动践行绿色发展理念，播撒生态希望；有的创新传播形式，借助情景再现、反诈宣传等群众喜闻乐见的方式，让助人向善的雷锋精神深入人心；有的深耕校园服务，开展环境清扫、共享单车整理、公共设施隐患排查等行动，用点滴付出守护校园美好；还有的延伸服务触角，开展学业帮扶、关爱流浪动物、寻访身边雷锋、聆听老干部奋斗故事等特色活动，让志愿服务既有广度更有深度。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=mUzfNRM4N4L7W7MT47ZUlL8U4viM7Mt7o7rVUNLsollPMzC0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyaokyiLkyYM4fRnllsU4vsLRVfUl7YMmvDL7-YL7LsnzAFoRCYL4CsLzrFLNl8U47Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0Lz9aoR9Jqdjnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=18088&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/50850270CEE7C7701AAA26760B20C7E8/86236715/2E4C1\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=mUzfNRM4N4L7W7MT47ZUlL8U4viM7Mt7o7rVUNLsollPMzC0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyaokyiLkyYM4fRnllsU4vsLRVfUl7YMmvDL7-YL7LsnzAFoRCYL4CsLzrFLNl8U47Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0Lz9aoR9Jqdjnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=18088&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=mM4rNVMNVfM4L8oTz-aUmLsnmr7U4Tt2oR-aUmU4nR-bMzl0gihFp2hmCIa0MYy8Lky4MYyaoRUsUmCDn7C4MlUZMNV7LRQ2Mznkn77inmMFU8U8Mz-aL4WFLmviU4lJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0Lz9aoR9Jqdjnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=18088&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/740370847B66DF35D86AD06F54BDA5F3/CD452032/275C5\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=mM4rNVMNVfM4L8oTz-aUmLsnmr7U4Tt2oR-aUmU4nR-bMzl0gihFp2hmCIa0MYy8Lky4MYyaoRUsUmCDn7C4MlUZMNV7LRQ2Mznkn77inmMFU8U8Mz-aL4WFLmviU4lJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0Lz9aoR9Jqdjnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=18088&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=mo7-N4oRM7oR7bUT8Qknmn7MRUYUz9tinmWfM8CiolU4oR90gihFp2hmCIa0UYh2LShRUYh7U4GaMmnVM7UaLmV7LllsM77aLlCYMRCsL8rFMzvsL7LYMmVFLNlDLR9Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0Lz9aoR9Jqdjnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=18088&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/CF1CCDC0064E4D021D1E74A01F24673E/5770C261/2E608\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=mo7-N4oRM7oR7bUT8Qknmn7MRUYUz9tinmWfM8CiolU4oR90gihFp2hmCIa0UYh2LShRUYh7U4GaMmnVM7UaLmV7LllsM77aLlCYMRCsL8rFMzvsL7LYMmVFLNlDLR9Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0Lz9aoR9Jqdjnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=18088&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=mL4GN8oRGPLmQVnT7C4UzV7UNr7nR-t4MR9bnzvsoR9aMm-0gihFp2hmCIa0USyaLYyaM1yYLRU8UNrVol-boRC8M4G4nl7YMN-4MmNYozrFM4L8MRv8UNrFLNr2U4NJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0Lz9aoR9Jqdjnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=18088&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A03062044BEE9B9864703EA26B369295/734474BE/2EFC9\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=mL4GN8oRGPLmQVnT7C4UzV7UNr7nR-t4MR9bnzvsoR9aMm-0gihFp2hmCIa0USyaLYyaM1yYLRU8UNrVol-boRC8M4G4nl7YMN-4MmNYozrFM4L8MRv8UNrFLNr2U4NJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0Lz9aoR9Jqdjnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=18088&e=.png\"></p><p>活动期间，精心穿插的文艺表演张弛有度，相声幽默风趣、舞蹈活力四射、歌曲深情悠扬，既缓解答辩现场的紧张氛围，更展现了材料学子多才多艺、积极向上的青春风貌，为答辩会增添了温馨氛围。评委们围绕活动组织成效、宣传影响、可持续性等核心维度，与各支部代表深入交流、精准点评，既肯定实践成果，也提出优化建议，推动志愿服务质量持续提升。<br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=mMRQNkLmvYL8liUT4TkMmUbUlWRMzLtYUz78Mzv8UmA7MRG0gihFp2hmCIa0MYh7Mky4U1y8M8UsM7l8MRCYnzN8LzL8LzQfUmNbnl74nNrFMmUboR-iM7VFLzr7LzlJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0Lz9aoR9Jqdjnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=18088&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7D43B47D74E4462E9413416AB99EA3FE/6498254A/15D15\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=mnRfN2nRL8UmL4nTzARnRlsU4LsMRWt2M8UZM7nfUm6RLRU0gihFp2hmCIa0USybnkyYMSh7n7WfnR74M77ZUz62L4Q7MN-ZoRGZMz7sLRQFM4TkLmCZMNWFUzT2L7CJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0Lz9aoR9Jqdjnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=18088&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=molLNYL4lZLRvYMTmfVLRlZLl-DUNlt4UlVfL8nkUN7YLm70gihFp2hmCIa0nShRoShRokhRozCDM7nkM8W7U8CPMRA7LRLPMlnfLzLYMR6Fnz74Uz-ioRVFLNlDLR9Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0Lz9aoR9Jqdjnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=18088&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/EC9C8C9664DB7BDCF148D0315DA13247/E13A2581/2E608\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=molLNYL4lZLRvYMTmfVLRlZLl-DUNlt4UlVfL8nkUN7YLm70gihFp2hmCIa0nShRoShRokhRozCDM7nkM8W7U8CPMRA7LRLPMlnfLzLYMR6Fnz74Uz-ioRVFLNlDLR9Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0Lz9aoR9Jqdjnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=18088&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=mnzVNVL8lZMlC8nTR9DM4-ZL8nRMzntVo7LZnNM7Um-4UmL0gihFp2hmCIa0LSh7UYyZnkyZM4GioR9sM8MkUzCbMlL8M46RMlQ7MNUiLNnFnNQVLz-DMlWFL4G4Ll-Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0Lz9aoR9Jqdjnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=18088&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1DC8D87058877CBA695C477C5FD6D52D/FFE1265B/3031B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=mnzVNVL8lZMlC8nTR9DM4-ZL8nRMzntVo7LZnNM7Um-4UmL0gihFp2hmCIa0LSh7UYyZnkyZM4GioR9sM8MkUzCbMlL8M46RMlQ7MNUiLNnFnNQVLz-DMlWFL4G4Ll-Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0Lz9aoR9Jqdjnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=18088&e=.png\"></p><p>此次答辩会不仅是对各支部“雷锋月”志愿实践的集中检阅，更是一场雷锋精神的传承与弘扬，彰显了“奉献、友爱、互助、进步”的志愿精神，凝聚了材料学子践行社会责任的青春共识。未来，材料科学与工程学院将以此次活动为契机，持续推动志愿服务常态化、品牌化发展，引导广大青年学子以青春之力践行雷锋精神，用实际行动书写新时代青年的责任与担当，让雷锋精神在校园中薪火相传、熠熠生辉。</p><p><br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":